Metal feel: slow and crushing, half-time — sustained power chords ANCHORED by palm-muted chugs (heavy, not empty)    Tempo: 60 bpm    Tala: Teentaal    One avartan = 16 beats.

THE SONG'S CORE IDEA (when the Composer seeded the piece, YOU wrote it — build on it). It holds
the gat HEAD'S IDEA: compose the mukhada FROM it, with your full attention — its first note the
